      "index": 7,
      "title": "出锅装盘",
      "instruction": "出锅前撒上点葱花装饰，即可享用。",
      "duration_sec": 30,
      "tips": [
        "趁热食用口感最软糯"
      ],
      "produces": "湘祁米夫鸭",
      "image": "https://cos.onmicrosoft.cn/cook/steps/other_xiang-qi-mi-fu-ya/step_7.jpg"
